+direct-at-truth acceptance can approach the nominal level while false-candidate rejection falls and most
+of the grid remains accepted. The strong-relevance undercoverage and documented power reversals in
+Section 4 remain material: neither nominal-looking acceptance nor a favourable point-estimation ranking
+establishes reliable and informative inference.
